  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat",
    "Thread 4 shrimp onto each skewer",
    "In a small bowl, mix together Cajun seasoning, brown sugar, honey, soy sauce, and garlic powder",
    "Brush the mixture onto both sides of the shrimp",
    "Grill the shrimp for 2-3 minutes per side",
    "Serve the shrimp hot with lemon wedges on the side",
    "Garnish with chopped parsley or dill if desired"
